    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000txb8](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000txb8) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 35.0 depth occurred on Nov 10 2026 43km S of Puerto San Jose. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 13.5381 longitude -90.8798. It impacted 59951 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
